| CX-BR-02 | MAJOR | [merge.py:236](/Users/kaygee/Code/loops/libs/store/src/store/merge.py:236), [merge.py:438](/Users/kaygee/Code/loops/libs/store/src/store/merge.py:438) | `merge_store` is a driver that directly mints target witness positions without signature or source-authorization admission. | A source fact with observer `mallory` and signature `"not-a-valid-signature"` produced `facts_added=1` and appeared in the target arrival log. The implementation acknowledges that it has no admission attestation, then calls `append_marked_many` directly at line 252. This violates both the admission boundary and the single-custodian law. |
